之喪，雖貴遂服，自天子達；而漢文除之，毀禮傷義，常以歎息。今主上天縱至孝，有曾閔之性，雖奪其服，實行喪禮。喪禮實行，除服何為邪！若因此革漢魏之薄，而興先王之法，以敦風俗，垂美百代，不亦善乎！」玄曰：「漢文以末世淺薄，不能行國君之喪，故因而除之。除之數百年，一旦復古，難行也。」祜曰：「不能使天下如禮，且使主上遂服，不猶善乎！」玄曰：「主上不除而天下除，此為但有父子，無復君臣，三綱之道虧矣。」祜乃止。","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"raw_start":5062,"raw_end":5279,"raw_character_offsets":[5064,5065,5066,5067,5068,5069,5070,5071,5072,5073,5074,5075,5076,5077,5078,5079,5080,5081,5082,5083,5084,5085,5086,5087,5088,5089,5090,5091,5092,5093,5094,5095,5096,5097,5098,5099,5100,5101,5102,5103,5104,5105,5106,5107,5108,5109,5110,5111,5112,5113,5114,5115,5116,5117,5118,5119,5120,5121,5122,5123,5124,5125,5126,5127,5128,5129,5130,5131,5132,5133,5134,5135,5136,5137,5138,5139,5140,5141,5142,5143,5144,5145,5146,5147,5148,5149,5150,5151,5152,5153,5154,5155,5156,5157,5158,5159,5160,5161,5162,5163,5164,5165,5166,5167,5168,5169,5170,5171,5172,5173,5174,5175,5176,5177,5178,5179,5180,5181,5182,5183,5184,5185,5186,5187,5188,5189,5190,5191,5192,5193,5194,5195,5196,5197,5198,5199,5200,5201,5202,5203,5204,5205,5206,5207,5208,5209,5210,5211,5212,5213,5214,5215,5216,5217,5218,5219,5220,5221,5222,5223,5224,5225,5226,5227,5228,5229,5230,5231,5232,5233,5234,5235,5236,5237,5238,5239,5240,5241,5242,5243,5244,5245,5246,5247,5248,5249,5250,5251,5252,5253,5254,5255,5256,5257,5258,5259,5260,5261,5262,5263,5264,5265,5266,5267,5268,5269,5270,5271,5272,5273,5274,5275,5276,5277,5278],"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"revision_id":2567662,"projection_sha256":"2168f1fa07e11159b481aeb3828eadc14911e489962d18781dbdc84963d51882","source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_subsection":" [[作者:羊祜|羊祜]] ","quotation_block_markup":false},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p030:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p030:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"dqd_5q9_pkz_BD","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p030:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface"